            <ArticleTitle>Implicit Theory of Mind - An overview of current replications and non-replications.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>101-104</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.1016/j.dib.2017.11.016</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>The current dataset contains a qualitative summary of (non-)replication studies of implicit Theory of Mind paradigms. It summarizes for each paradigm, how many replications, partial replications and non-replications were identified and how many of them were published or unpublished. Furthermore, descriptive data and sample sizes are reported. The dataset provides a qualitative overview of the published and unpublished findings in implicit Theory of Mind research.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
